00:44:27.540 --> 00:44:29.550
It goes in, creates
the query that

00:44:29.550 --> 00:44:39.770
says give me the current value
of every one of my stocks

00:44:39.770 --> 00:44:41.881
in every single one
of my portfolios

00:44:41.881 --> 00:44:43.630
for all the months
