00:45:17.830 --> 00:45:20.740
So there was just kind of a
slow moving downward trend,

00:45:20.740 --> 00:45:23.560
and a nice sharp upward
trend for a couple of things.

00:45:23.560 --> 00:45:25.750
And this is the exact
type of questions

00:45:25.750 --> 00:45:28.390
that people have that
until now, they wouldn't

00:45:28.390 --> 00:45:32.800
be able to dynamically answer.

00:45:32.800 --> 00:45:35.920
And especially with data that
