00:46:39.820 --> 00:46:41.790
So quick recap.

00:46:41.790 --> 00:46:47.400
So as of today you can analyze
Bigtable data using BigQuery.

00:46:47.400 --> 00:46:51.110
It is row range optimized
for the legacy SQL.

00:46:51.110 --> 00:46:55.350
The range optimization for
standard SQL is coming soon.

00:46:55.350 --> 00:46:57.750
That's why his queries were
taking 8 seconds and not

00:46:57.750 --> 00:46:58.290
2 seconds.

00:46:58.290 --> 00:47:00.480
That was our fault, not his.

00:47:00.480 --> 00:47:03.045
In a couple of weeks
the standard SQL

00:47:03.045 --> 00:47:06.420
will also be as lightning
fast as the legacy SQL.

00:47:06.420 --> 00:47:09.750
And that in short you get the
best of both analytical data

00:47:09.750 --> 00:47:13.770
stores by using this connector.

00:47:13.770 --> 00:47:14.610
So thank you.

